VALUES ('ex-arnold-press', 'arnold-press', NULL, 'Arnold Press', 'Dumbbell exercise for the shoulders, with biceps, triceps assisting.', ARRAY['Set up an adjustable angle bench to 90 degrees and grab two dumbbells from the rack.', 'Pick up the dumbbells from the floor using a neutral grip (palms facing in).', 'Position the end of the dumbbells on your knees and sit down on the bench.', 'Using a safe and controlled motion, kick your knees up one at a time in order to get each dumbbell into place.', 'Once the dumbbells are in place, rotate your palms so they are facing you.', 'Take a deep breath then press the dumbbells overhead by extending the elbows and contracting the deltoids.', 'As you press, rotate the dumbbells until your palms are facing forward.', 'Slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position (the arms should be roughly 90 degrees or slightly lower depending upon limb lengths).']::TEXT[], 'COMPOUND'::"ExerciseCategory", 'STRENGTH'::"ExerciseType", 'SHOULDERS'::"MuscleGroup", 'DUMBBELL'::"EquipmentType", NULL, ARRAY['arnold drücken', 'seated arnold dumbbell press', 'shoulders']::TEXT[], true, NOW(), NOW())
